All checks pass. Here's a summary of what was implemented:

### Changes

**`internal/config/config.go`** — Added `ModelParams.Equal(other ModelParams) bool` that compares all scalar fields and does element-by-element comparison of `Extra []string`, avoiding `==` on slices and `reflect.DeepEqual`.

**`internal/process/manager.go`** — Added `Manager.Reload(newCfg *config.Config)`:
- Logs a warning for `Listen` address changes (requires restart)
- Holds `m.mu` only briefly to update `m.cfg` and collect drain operations (sets state to `stateUnloading`)
- Releases lock, then cancels all affected processes in parallel, waits for each to exit (avoids the deadlock with supervisor goroutines)
- Re-acquires lock to delete drained entries, then calls `startSupervisor` for models with changed params and new warmup models

**`internal/gateway/gateway.go`** — Changed `cfg *config.Config` to `cfg atomic.Pointer[config.Config]` for lock-free reads on the hot path. Added `Gateway.UpdateConfig(cfg *config.Config)`. Updated `handleRoute` and `handleHealth` to read via `g.cfg.Load()`.

**`internal/process/manager_test.go`** — Four new tests: `TestReload_ParamsChanged`, `TestReload_ParamsUnchanged`, `TestReload_RemovedModel`, `TestReload_NewWarmupModel`.

**`internal/gateway/gateway_test.go`** — `TestGateway_UpdateConfig` verifies old model returns 404 before update and new model routes successfully after.
